        "Node name for S&R": "Seedream FAST \u2014 Slide 02"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Recreate this scene from image 1 as a bright, warm, sun-kissed moment \u2014 an overhead view of four people playing Spoons, hands reaching for cards and spoons amid the chaos of the game. Use image 2 (the approved slide 3 result) as the reference for correct identity, wardrobe, lighting style, camera lensing, and carpet \u2014 this set must feel like one continuous shoot with image 2.\n\nCRITICAL \u2014 POSITIONING: The player wearing the red hoodie in image 1 is in the wrong position. Match image 2's actual seating arrangement: reposition her to the opposite side of the circle from where she currently sits, on the same side as she appears in image 2 relative to the man in the tan/cream striped shirt. Rearrange the other players' positions around the circle as needed to stay consistent with image 2's spatial layout.\n\nCRITICAL \u2014 WARDROBE: The woman currently in the bright red hoodie must instead wear the burnt-orange/rust long-sleeve top shown on her in image 2 \u2014 NOT red. Match her exact top from image 2.\n\nCRITICAL \u2014 ARM PROPORTIONS: The arm reaching into the pile of cards is unnaturally long and looks artificial. Correct it to realistic human arm proportions and length, matching the natural proportions of the arms and hands in image 2.\n\nCARDS: Fix every playing card \u2014 held, mid-toss, and scattered \u2014 to be fully accurate, legible standard playing cards with correct suits and ranks. No garbled, invented, duplicated, or illegible cards. NO Jokers anywhere in the scene \u2014 Spoons uses a standard 52-card deck with jokers removed.\n\nGLASSES: Correct the proportions of every rocks glass in the scene to realistic, consistent size and shape \u2014 matching the faceted cut-crystal rocks glasses shown in image 2, not oversized, undersized, or distorted.\n\nBOTTLE: Correct the bottle's proportions to a realistic, accurate 750mL tequila bottle size. Use image 3 (front bottle) and image 4 (label close-up) to keep the Hornitos Reposado bottle and label accurate and sharp \u2014 the green diamond \"HORNITOS\" / \"REPOSADO\" label, correctly shaped, colored, and legible.\n\nCARPET: Replace the surface with the modern textured rug shown in image 5 \u2014 a rich moss-green tufted wool rug with a looped-and-cut geometric ridge pattern in nested rectangular bands, deep varied pile texture, matching image 2's carpet exactly.\n\nLIGHTING & LENS: Match image 2's lighting and camera lensing exactly \u2014 bright, warm, golden sun-kissed light raking across the scene with glowing highlights and soft warm shadows, and the same natural lens perspective and depth of field as image 2, so this slide feels shot on the same camera in the same moment as image 2.\n\nSTYLE: Bright, vibrant, premium Hornitos lifestyle photography \u2014 warm, golden, airy, sun-drenched, elevated but authentic and candid. Clean filmic grade, warm skin tones, punchy natural contrast, subtle grain.\n\nAVOID: red clothing in place of burnt-orange; wrong seating positions; unnaturally long or distorted arms and hands; any Joker card; garbled, invented, or illegible playing cards; incorrect glass or bottle proportions; garbled or incorrect bottle label; the old carpet; lighting or lensing that doesn't match image 2; blown-out highlights.",
        "seedream-5.0-pro",
        "auto_2K",
        "png",
        1,
        true,
        0,
        "randomize",
        1,
        2048,
        2048,
        1
      ],
      "title": "Seedream FAST \u2014 Slide 02"
